  "description": "Having a huge crush on Varney the tattoo artist, Eden dresses up and walks over to his parlor to impress him. But one thing leads to another, and he's bouncing on top of Varney in a tattoo chair with a bite mark on his neck! Not long after the vampire wrecks him, Eden somehow finds himself alone in the parlor with Lobold, a werewolf in heat! As he's ravaged by one supernatural being after the other, Eden can't help but wonder if tattoos really are bad luck, like his mother said... \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
